{"municipality_code":"19346","pref":"山梨県","city":"市川三郷町","headline":"村の境界の痕跡があるかもしれません。","display_comment_enriched":"市川三郷町には、地域の歴史や暮らしを伝える案内板や石碑があり、それらを手がかりに街歩きを楽しめます。 周辺には寺社や信仰の場、史跡や遺跡にまつわる場所が点在し、「古城山砦跡」、「市川代官所跡」、「黒沢口留番所跡」などを起点に歩くと、地域の歴史がぐっと見えやすくなります。 現地では史跡説明板が、地域の歴史を読み解く手がかりになるでしょう。 川沿いや水辺では、暮らしや堤防整備の歴史を伝える案内板、治水碑、河川改修の記念碑にも注目してみてください。 「平塩寺」や「宝寿院（甲斐西八代七福神 福禄寿）」などの名所も、地域の物語を深掘りする絶好の入口です。 さらに、「和紙」や「ハンコ」といった名物や食文化に触れると、その土地らしい暮らしまで感じられるでしょう。","radar_groups":[{"id":"town","title":"街の基盤","metrics":[{"id":"dining","label":"飲食店","short_label":"飲食","count":65,"rank":761,"percentile":59.6,"national_average":234.0,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"parks","label":"公園・遊具","short_label":"公園","count":1,"rank":1311,"percentile":22.8,"national_average":35.1,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"public","label":"公共施設","short_label":"公共","count":53,"rank":425,"percentile":77.0,"national_average":39.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"culture","label":"文化施設","short_label":"文化","count":8,"rank":1011,"percentile":40.6,"national_average":12.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"landscape","label":"景観・樹木","short_label":"景観","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.2,"municipality_total":1896}]},{"id":"history","title":"歴史資産","metrics":[{"id":"temples_shrines","label":"寺社仏閣","short_label":"寺社","count":5,"rank":776,"percentile":53.6,"national_average":8.9,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"historic_sites","label":"史跡・遺跡","short_label":"史跡","count":7,"rank":631,"percentile":63.2,"national_average":7.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"roads_posts","label":"街道・宿場","short_label":"街道","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":1.2,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"villages","label":"近世村","short_label":"近世村","count":24,"rank":711,"percentile":61.6,"national_average":31.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"civil","label":"土木遺産","short_label":"土木","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.3,"municipality_total":1896}]}],"culture_cards":{"notable_peopl